Description: Zuma Deluxe HD - A remake of the classic PopCap game
 Zuma-Deluxe-HD is a C-based remake of the 2003 PopCap game Zuma,
 featuring improved HD textures and 16:9 aspect ratio support.
 .
 The project uses SDL2 for graphics, BASS audio library for sound,
 and libexpat for XML parsing.
